について、前回公表予想を上回る見込みとなりましたので、上記のとおり業績予想を修正いたします。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "（2026年５月12日発表）", null, "CurrentYearInstant_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 30, "30.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 45, "45.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 75, "75.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 30, "30.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 55, "55.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 85, "85.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 20, "20.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 35, "35.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 55, "55.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["ReasonForDividendForecastCorrection", "ReasonForDividendForecastCorrection", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "当社は、株主の皆様に対する利益還元を経営上の重要課題の一つと認識しており、毎年の配当金につきましては、安定的な配当の維持を基本としつつ、中期経営計画に掲げる配当性向50％以上を目標に、配当水準の引き上げを検討していく方針です。　このたび、2027年３月期通期連結業績予想の見直しを踏まえ、上記配当基本方針に基づき、2027年３月期の期末配当予想を前回予想から１株当たり10円増配し、55円に修正することといたしました。これにより、年間配当予想は85円（前期比30円の増配）となります。（注）業績予想につきましては、本資料の発表日現在において入手可能な情報に基づき作成したものであり、実際の業績等は、今後様々な要因によって予想数値と異なる結果となる可能性があります。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["FiscalYearEnd", "FiscalYearEnd", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2027-03-31", null, "CurrentYearInstant"]]}}